Package: CopulaOne
Title: Full-Range Tail Dependence Copulas
Version: 0.1.0.000
Authors@R: person("Lei", "Hua", email = "larry.lei.hua@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements bivariate FRA1, GGEE, and PPPP copulas with full-range
    upper and lower tail dependence. Provides density and distribution
    functions, simulation, dependence measures, and maximum likelihood fitting.
